EXT. HARBOUR WALL - NIGHT

= The storm reaches the town.

Waves break over the wall. A lamp swings on its hook.

!THE LAMP GOES OUT.
Everyone stops.

DANA
(shouting)
Bring the boats in.

@Priya
They won't come in for us.

.THE LIGHTHOUSE STAIRS

Sam climbs, counting the steps under his breath.

